OL,3,GNEWSAPlay area where school 'poured
OL,4,Aheart and soul' smashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA play area where school staff poured
OL,7,Ftheir "heart and soul" has been
OL,8,Fdestroyed, leaving children devastated,
OL,9,Fa head teacher has said.
OL,11,FThe facility, at Roseberry Primary and
OL,12,FNursery School in Newfield, near
OL,13,FChester-le-Street, had a mud kitchen,
OL,14,Fmini golf course, play baths and fire
OL,15,Fpit.
OL,17,FBut head teacher Emma Dunn said staff
OL,18,Fcame in on Tuesday to find broken toys
OL,19,Fand some of the equipment "smashed to
OL,20,Fpieces".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
