OL,3,GNEWSAPlay area where school 'poured
OL,4,Aheart and soul' smashed
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We poured our heart and soul into it
OL,7,Fto make it the best that it can be for
OL,8,Four children," she said. "It's really
OL,9,Fupsetting to see."
